The MIT licence in LICENSE covers only the project's own code. It does not
cover anything named below, or the map data and other content the site shows.

Served from this site today (dist/): nothing from a third party.

- The page and the offline worker are the project's own code. The build's
  tools (esbuild, TypeScript) leave no third-party code in the worker.

